          "copyright": "All scripture included with express permission from Biblica, Crossway and Biblical Studies Press, LLC For more copyright information, visit yotoplay.com/products/steadfast",
          "description": "Steadfast is a calming collection of scripture memory songs crafted to bring peace and presence to the everyday rhythms of life. These songs are prayers and promises from all over the Bible for when things aren’t as they should be, passages of hope and God’s faithfulness in the midst of the hard moments. The melodies are intentionally simple, and the songs are purposefully arranged to create space to slow down and breathe deep. Whether in the car, at the table, or on the floor with blocks, Steadfast offers a musical invitation to remember and rest.\n\nFor the NIV: Scriptures taken from the Holy Bible, New International Version TM, NIV TM Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide.  For the NET Bible:  The Scriptures quoted are from the NET Bible® https://netbible.com copyright ©1996, 2019 used with permission from Biblical Studies Press, L.L.C. All rights reserved  For the ESV: Scripture quotations are from the ESV® Bible (The Holy Bible, English Standard Version®), © 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers. Used by permission. All rights reserved.",
